WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.488
We are having a blood test. It is quick. Here is what will happen.

2
00:00:07.488 --> 00:00:12.624
We sit in a comfy chair and rest our arm on the rest.

3
00:00:12.624 --> 00:00:15.720
We roll our sleeve up.

4
00:00:15.720 --> 00:00:22.464
The nurse ties a tight band around our arm. It feels like a squeeze.

5
00:00:22.464 --> 00:00:28.536
There is a quick pinch when the needle goes in. We can look away.

6
00:00:28.536 --> 00:00:34.872
A small tube fills with blood. It takes less than a minute.

7
00:00:34.872 --> 00:00:40.200
The needle comes out, and we get a plaster or cotton ball.

8
00:00:40.200 --> 00:00:44.616
All done. We did the whole thing.

9
00:00:44.616 --> 00:00:52.824
All done. Now you know what will happen. You can watch this again any time.

